  "reference": "Mase 21",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo akwawula ku Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitwamasile kwalanga ŵiŵatupecesye ŵala, twatyosile kweleko mcombo, nipo twajesile mwakulunjika ni kwika ku Kosi. Kundaŵi kwakwe twapite kwika ku Lodi, nipo kutyocela kweleko twapite kwika soni ku Patala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kweleko twacisimene combo cicajawulaga ku Fenisiya. Nipo twakwesile mwelemo ni kwawulaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twayice pa malo pele pitwaciweni cilumba ca Saipulasi, nipo twajesile kum'mwela kwakwe mpaka twayice ku Siliya. Twajesile mungulugulu nyasa mpaka twayice ku Taya, pakuŵa comboco cajawulaga kweleko kutulusya katundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kweleko twasimene ŵakulijiganya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵane nipo twatemi nawo masiku msano ni gaŵili. Mwamacili ga Msimu Ŵaswela ŵakulijiganyawo ŵamsalile Paulo kuti akasajawula ku Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo pijamasile ndaŵi jetu jakutama ni ŵanduwo, twatyosile ni kupitilisya ulendo wetu. Wosopewo pampepe ni aciŵamkwawo ni ŵanace ŵatupecesye mpaka kusa kwa msindawo, kweleko wosope twatindiŵele pa msanga mungulugulu nyasa ni kupopela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko twamlanjile jwalijose, ni twakwesile combo, jemanjajo ni kuwujilaga msimangwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twapitilisye ulendo wetu m'nyasa kutyocela ku Taya mpaka ku Tolemaisi. Kweleko twakomasisye acimjetu ni twatemi nawo kwa lisiku limope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kundaŵi kwakwe twatyosile ni twayice ku Kaisaleya. Kweleko twatemi m'nyumba ja Filipi juŵaliji jwakulalicila,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jumo jwa ŵandu msano ni ŵaŵili ŵiŵasagwile kuŵa ŵakamucisya mu Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mase 6:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵakwete ŵanace ŵacakongwe mcece ŵamkanalombedweje nipo ŵalocesyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe tuli kweleko ku Kaisaleya kwa masiku ga panandi, kwayice jwakulocesya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lina lyakwe Agabu kutyocela ku Yudeya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.11.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mase 11:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwejo ŵayice kwetuwe, nipo ŵajigele lamba jwa Paulo ni ŵalitaŵile sajo syakwe ni makono gakwe acitiji, “Yeleyi ni yakuti Msimu Ŵaswela, msyene aju lambaju tacitaŵidwa camti myiyi ni Ayuda ku Yelusalemu, nipo tacipelecedwa m'myala mwa ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitwapikene yeleyi, uwe pamo ni ŵandu ŵa kweleko twamŵendile Paulo kuti akasajawula ku Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Paulo ŵajanjile kuti, “Ana mkutenda uli, kulila kwamti myiyi, kwakusaka kunjasikasya cikulupi cangu? Unetu, ndili cile ngaŵaga kutaŵidwape ku Yelusalemu, nambo atamose kuja kuwila kweleko kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Yesu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo pakuti twalepele kumlekasya, twamlesile ni kuŵeceta kuti, “Yitendedwe yele yakusaka Ambuje.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitwamasile kutama kweleko kwa ndaŵi nditu, twataŵile yindu yetu nipo twapite ku Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakulijiganya ŵane ŵa ku Kaisaleya ŵatukuyisye. Ŵapite kutuleka ku nyumba ja mundu jwine lina lyakwe Mnasoni, kwele kutwatiga tukatameje. Jwalakwe ŵaliji mundu jwa ku Saipulasi nipo ŵaliji jumo jwa ŵakulijiganya ŵandanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo akuja kukunguluka ni Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitwayice ku Yelusalemu, acalongo acimjetu ŵatupocele cenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kundaŵi kwakwe Paulo ŵatujigele kwawula kukumlola Yakobo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nipo acakulungwa ŵa mpingo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wosope ŵaliji papopo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo ŵakomasisye jemanjajo wosope nipo ŵasalile yosope yiŵatesile Mlungu kwa ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine kupitila mu utumiki wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵamasile kumpikanila jwalakwe, wosope ŵamtogolele Mlungu. Nipo ŵatite, “Paulo mlongo mjetu, mlole Ayuda ŵajinji mnope ŵakulupilile, wosopewo ali ŵakulupicika mnope pakugakuya Malamusi ga Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵapikene kuti wawo ŵajiganyaga Ayuda wosope ŵakutama pampepe ni ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine, kuti alekangane nago malamusi ga Mosego. Soni mwasalilaga jemanjajo kuti akawumbasyaga ŵanace ŵawo kapena kujisamala misyungu ja Ayuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano pelepa tutende cici? Kusyene nditu tacipikana kuti jemanja myice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni sambano, jemanja mtende yele yitumsalile uwe. Apano pana acalume mcece ŵiŵatesile cilanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.6.13+NUM.6.14+NUM.6.15+NUM.6.16+NUM.6.17+NUM.6.18+NUM.6.19+NUM.6.20+NUM.6.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 6:13-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlongane nawo jemanjaji ni mkatende nawo msyungu wakuliswejesya. Mkalipile mbiya syakuti akapelece ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE kuti akasenje umbo syawo. Pakutenda yeleyi jwalijose tamanyilile kuti yaliji ya unami yiŵaliji mkwasalila yakwayana ni m'mwejo Paulo, nambo kuti mwasyene mkugasamala Malamusi ga Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo kuŵeceta ya ŵandu ŵa mitundu jine ŵakulupilila, twalembele yikalata kwasalila yindu yitukamulene kuti akalyaga cakulya cilicose cacipelecedwe kwa milungu jine kapena miasi atamose nyama jilijose jakupopotola nipo soni akatenda cikululu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
